  "victory": {
    "side": "us",
    "text": "The Americans win if, at the end of turn 7, they control at least two of the ridge crest, the hilltop house and the vineyard house; or at once if the German garrison surrenders after losing 6 squads, crews and vehicles. The Americans lose at once if they lose 8 squads, crews and vehicles themselves. An objective is controlled by the side that has an unbroken infantry unit in it and no enemy units in any of its hexes. Otherwise the Germans win.",
